.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="In Tsvet&#x27;s experiment a pigment extract moves down a chalk column, each pigment at its own speed u/(1+k) set by how strongly it is retained (retention factor k). Snapshots of the column show the mixture resolving into separate colored bands; at the column outlet a detector records the same separation as a chromatogram, rendered here by simulate_chromatogram.">

.. only:: html

  .. image:: /api/gallery/analytical/chromatography/images/thumb/sphx_glr_plot_01_tsvet_column_chromatography_thumb.png
